Forge archetype: Runner. Bias toward walking or running where appropriate, marching, aerobic movement, ankle and calf durability, and sustainable lower-body endurance. Limitations always override running specificity.
In the catalog this means running-pattern and cardio drills (skipping, butt kicks, high knees, low-amplitude bounding), calf raises and ankle work, single-leg strength (lunges, step-ups, single-leg bridges), hamstring and glute endurance, and hip-flexor and calf mobility. Upper-body pushing is a minor accessory, not a focus.
